cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Combat3D: Monocular 3D Human Pose in High-Occlusion Contact Sports without Motion Capture"
message: "If you use this code, data or checkpoints, please cite the paper."
type: software
license: MIT
# ★ TODO: 建好仓库后把 I-min-Lee 换掉
repository-code: "https://github.com/I-min-Lee/Combat3D"
abstract: >-
  A zero-manual-annotation multi-view 3D label-production framework for
  high-occlusion, close-contact combat sports, plus the monocular lifting recipe
  built on it. Provides a layer-wise error budget for the zero-annotation route,
  seven ablation-backed findings, and a root-regression head that recovers
  absolute world-space placement (996 mm to 9 mm median error).
keywords:
  - 3D human pose estimation
  - monocular
  - multi-view
  - pseudo-labels
  - occlusion
  - combat sports
  - Harmony4D
authors:
  - family-names: "Lee"
    given-names: "I-min"
    # ★ TODO: 补单位（英文全称），例如 "Department of ..., ... University"
    affiliation: "<Institution>"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-10-05"
